  "worked_solution": "We substitute $u=5$ and $v=3$ into the function definition and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g(u,v) & =3\\cdot {5}^{2u-3v}-2u \\\\ g(5,3) & =3\\cdot {5}^{2(5)-3(3)}-2(5) \\\\  & =3\\cdot {5}^{10-9}-10 \\\\  & =3\\cdot {5}^{1}-10 \\\\  & =15-10 \\\\  & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
